# Order in which scripts/apply_engine_patches.sh applies the skia-*.patch files.
# One file name per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Some patches are cut against the result of earlier ones, so glob (alphabetical)
# order is not safe: skia-fit-reserve.patch touches lines that
# skia-fractional-line-heights and skia-style-line-indents-metrics add, and fails
# six hunks on a fresh tree if it goes first. A new patch goes at the END of
# this list unless it was cut against a fresh tree, in which case anywhere does.
# A skia-*.patch missing from this file is still applied, after the listed ones.
skia-fractional-line-heights.patch
skia-freetype-linear-size.patch
skia-justify-ideographic-space.patch
skia-long-word-next-line.patch
skia-no-line-spacing-shift.patch
skia-pdf-fake-bold.patch
skia-run-shift-once.patch
skia-scale-x.patch
skia-shaper-scale-x.patch
skia-stencil-nullcheck.patch
skia-style-line-indents-metrics.patch
skia-fit-reserve.patch
skia-run-text-clusters.patch
skia-run-spacer-glyphs.patch
skia-ink-shift-friend.patch
skia-justify-space-after-word.patch
skia-rtl-paint-logical-order.patch
skia-pdf-glyph0-tounicode.patch
skia-space-then-zwsp-is-space.patch
skia-justify-every-space.patch
skia-pdf-cluster-text-once.patch
